                 fuera del aro; el mismo gorro de graduación y el mismo verde que el hexágono de Student. -->
            <ui:ProfessorHexTile x:Name="EstudioTile" AbsoluteLayout.LayoutBounds="555,409,146,168" AccentColor="#F3C701" Text="Modo de estudio" IconSource="ico_estudio.png" Tapped="OnModuleTapped"
                IconGeometry="M251.76,88.94 L131.76,24.94 C130.67,24.35 129.38,24 128,24 C126.62,24 125.33,24.35 124.2,24.96 L124.24,24.94 L4.24,88.94 C1.7,90.31 0,92.96 0,96 C0,99.04 1.7,101.69 4.2,103.04 L4.24,103.06 L32,117.87 L32,166.29 L32,166.32 C32,170.41 33.54,174.14 36.07,176.95 L36.06,176.94 C49.16,191.53 78.51,216 128,216 C128.32,216 128.7,216 129.08,216 C145.95,216 162.08,212.79 176.88,206.93 L176,207.24 L176,240 C176,244.42 179.58,248 184,248 C188.42,248 192,244.42 192,240 L192,199.51 C202.75,193.24 211.96,185.74 219.85,177.04 L219.94,176.94 C222.46,174.14 224,170.41 224,166.32 L224,166.29 L224,117.87 L251.76,103.06 C254.3,101.69 256,99.04 256,96 C256,92.96 254.3,90.31 251.8,88.96 L251.76,88.94 Z M128,200 C84.73,200 59.28,178.86 48,166.29 L48,126.4 L124.24,167.06 C125.33,167.65 126.62,168 128,168 C129.38,168 130.67,167.65 131.8,167.04 L131.76,167.06 L176,143.47 L176,189.81 C163.4,195.69 147.52,200 128,200 Z M208,166.25 C203.23,171.53 197.99,176.21 192.29,180.3 L192,180.5 L192,134.93 L208,126.4 Z M188,118.94 L187.78,118.81 L131.78,88.94 C130.72,88.39 129.47,88.06 128.14,88.06 C123.72,88.06 120.14,91.65 120.14,96.06 C120.14,99.06 121.79,101.67 124.22,103.04 L124.26,103.06 L171,128 L128,150.93 L25,96 L128,41.07 L231,96 Z" />

            <!-- «Evaluaciones» (MOD-010): aplicar un examen de los cursos instalados y abrir el panel de los ya aplicados, sin entrar a una clase. Ocupa la celda libre
                 a la izquierda de «Calendario», bajo «Dispositivos» y «Enciclopedia». Portapapeles con cabecera y tres renglones: sólo líneas y esquinas de 16 px
                 con arcos grandes (nada diminuto que Win2D no pueda pintar). -->
            <ui:ProfessorHexTile x:Name="EvaluacionesTile" AbsoluteLayout.LayoutBounds="79,409,146,168" AccentColor="#5B45D1" Text="Evaluaciones" IconSource="ico_examen.png" Tapped="OnModuleTapped"
